  "note": "Island Bridge — main Daugava northwest lower gallery. Original, individually controlled member of the complete Island Bridge system. Sheltered lower pedestrian gallery: actual floor, inner painted wall, thin roof lining, low open-sided parapet and tubular handrail. Its walkway elevation is independent of the upper roadway. Ordinary-photo medium-fi exterior approximation. Span stations, deck heights, concealed bearing/foundation sections and modern renovation details are estimates; current standard map geometry controls position and extent. The wider bridge-system inventory and actual native terrain/water/road-path contacts remain pending. These source models do not constitute readiness approvals. No photograph textures, readable graffiti or signage, downloaded meshes, interiors, traffic or engineering-clearance certification. Physical laptop/phone timings remain unmeasured. Preview places the authored base at the recorded absolute sea-level elevation; local tide and terrain resolution remain host-dependent."
